"technical point of view, there are 15 :ref:`field types <studio/fields/field-"
"types>` in Odoo. However, you can choose from 20 field types in Studio, as "
"some field types are available more than once with a different default "
"widget;"
msgstr ""
":ref:`menambahkan field baru <studio/fields/add-new>` ke database Anda. Dari "
"sudut pandang teknis, terdapat 15 :ref:`tipe field <studio/fields/field-"
"types>` di Odoo. Namun, Anda dapat memilih dari 20 tipe field di Studio, "
"karena beberapa tipe field tersedia lebih dari sekali dengan widget default "
"yang berbeda;"

#: ../../content/applications/studio/fields.rst:16
msgid ""
":ref:`add existing fields, <studio/fields/add-existing>` i.e., fields that "
"already exists on a model, to any view of that model;"
msgstr ""
":ref:`menambahkan field yang ada, <studio/fields/add-existing>` yaitu field "
"yang sudah ada pada suatu model, ke view mana pun dari model tersebut;"

#: ../../content/applications/studio/fields.rst:18
